  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Data Link Solutions has $292M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Data Link Solutions has 102 awards so far, with an average award size of $2.9M, and obligations are down 28.1% year over year. Data Link Solutions has multi-year activity, with fiscal-year obligations of $314M in FY21, $232M in FY22, $306M in FY23, $320M in FY24, and $407M in FY25. Data Link Solutions concentrates most obligations in communications equipment manufacturing. Data Link Solutions has $277M in obligations in Other Communications Equipment Manufacturing for FY2026 to date, followed by smaller obligations in Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing at $11.9M and Electronic and Precision Equipment Repair and Maintenance at $3.3M. Data Link Solutions records other small entries across specialized NAICS lines, including negative figures in several categories such as Other Metal Valve and Pipe Fitting Manufacturing and Bare Printed Circuit Board Manufacturing.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "How large are Data Link Solutions' FY2026 federal obligations?",
        "body": "Data Link Solutions has $292M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Data Link Solutions has 102 awards with an average award size of $2.9M. Data Link Solutions obligations are down 28.1% year over year. Data Link Solutions had higher obligations in FY25 at $407M and lower obligations in FY22 at $232M."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What are Data Link Solutions' primary product and market categories?",
        "body": "Other Communications Equipment Manufacturing is Data Link Solutions' largest market with $277M in obligations for FY2026 to date. Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing is the next largest market at $11.9M, followed by Electronic and Precision Equipment Repair and Maintenance at $3.3M. Data Link Solutions also records smaller or negative obligations in several specialized manufacturing and repair categories such as Other Metal Valve and Pipe Fitting Manufacturing and Bare Printed Circuit Board Manufacturing."
      }
    ]
  },
